    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3868" root="ترح" body-key="t">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَرْحَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A grief; a sorrow; an unhappiness.</i>
(L.) [Hence the saying,] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَامِنْ فَرَحَهْ إِلَّا وَبَعْدَهَا</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَرْحَهْ</span> [<i>There is no joy but there is after it a
grief</i>]. (A.)

